<!-- Lần mở đầu của bản Store: cho user chọn folder lưu tài liệu (gợi ý sẵn ổ khác ổ C). Lưu vào folders.root. -->
<Window x:Class="SoHocTap.Ui.FolderSetupWindow"
        FontFamily="{DynamicResource AppFontFamily}" FontSize="{DynamicResource AppFontSize}"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        xmlns:ui="clr-namespace:SoHocTap.Ui"
        Title="{ui:T setup.title}" Width="560" SizeToContent="Height" ResizeMode="NoResize"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner" ShowInTaskbar="False" Icon="/app.ico">
    <!-- Màn hình thấp hoặc chữ lớn: cửa sổ không cao quá vùng làm việc (WindowPlacement.FitToWorkArea), nội dung cuộn được. -->
    <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
    <StackPanel Margin="24,20,24,20">
        <TextBlock Text="{ui:T setup.title}" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}" FontSize="{DynamicResource AppFontSizeTitle}" />
        <TextBlock Text="{ui:T setup.text}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,8,0,16" />
        <DockPanel>
            <Button DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="{ui:T settings.browse}" Margin="8,0,0,0" Click="OnBrowse" />
            <TextBox x:Name="Folder" AutomationProperties.Name="{ui:T settings.root}" TextChanged="OnChanged" />
        </DockPanel>
        <TextBlock x:Name="Note" Style="{StaticResource Muted}" Margin="0,6,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" />
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,20,0,0">
            <Button x:Name="Ok" Content="{ui:T setup.ok}" Style="{DynamicResource AccentButtonStyle}" MinWidth="120" IsDefault="True" Click="OnOk" />
        </StackPanel>
    </StackPanel>
    </ScrollViewer>
</Window>
